<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<form:Form xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:core="http://g5.1c.ru/v8/dt/mcore" xmlns:form="http://g5.1c.ru/v8/dt/form">
  <items xsi:type="form:Decoration">
    <name>TextDecoration</name>
    <id>1</id>
    <title>
      <key>en</key>
      <value>Refund receipts are generated from receipts 
using the point of sale workplace.</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>fa</key>
      <value>رسیدهای بازپرداخت از رسیدها 
با استفاده از میز کار نقطه فروش ایجاد می‌شوند.</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>it</key>
      <value>Gli assegni della cassa fiscale per reso vengono inseriti sulla base degli assegni  della cassa fiscale
dal posto di lavoro del cassiere.</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>pl</key>
      <value>Paragony kasowe na zwrot są wprowadzane tylko na podstawie paragonów kasowych 
z miejsca roboczego kasjera.</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>ru</key>
      <value>Чеки ККМ на возврат вводятся только на основании чеков ККМ
из рабочего места кассира ККМ.</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>tr</key>
      <value>Yazar kasa iade fişleri, yalnızca yazar kasa kasiyerinin çalışma alanından kesilen
yazar kasa fişlerine göre girilir.</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>vi</key>
      <value>Phiếu tính tiền trả lại chỉ được nhập trên cơ sở Phiếu tính tiền
từ nơi làm việc của nhân viên thu ngân.</value>
    </title>
    <visible>true</visible>
    <enabled>true</enabled>
    <userVisible>
      <common>true</common>
    </userVisible>
    <extendedTooltip>
      <name>TextDecorationExtendedTooltip</name>
      <id>3</id>
      <type>Label</type>
      <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
      <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
      <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
        <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
      </extInfo>
    </extendedTooltip>
    <contextMenu>
      <name>TextDecorationContextMenu</name>
      <id>2</id>
      <autoFill>true</autoFill>
    </contextMenu>
    <type>Label</type>
    <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
    <textColor xsi:type="core:ColorRef">
      <color>Style.SpecialTextColor</color>
    </textColor>
    <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
      <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
    </extInfo>
  </items>
  <autoCommandBar>
    <name>FormCommandBar</name>
    <id>-1</id>
    <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
    <autoFill>true</autoFill>
  </autoCommandBar>
  <handlers>
    <event>OnCreateAtServer</event>
    <name>OnCreateAtServer</name>
  </handlers>
  <saveWindowSettings>true</saveWindowSettings>
  <autoTitle>true</autoTitle>
  <autoUrl>true</autoUrl>
  <group>Vertical</group>
  <autoFillCheck>true</autoFillCheck>
  <allowFormCustomize>true</allowFormCustomize>
  <enabled>true</enabled>
  <verticalScroll>UseIfNecessary</verticalScroll>
  <showTitle>true</showTitle>
  <showCloseButton>true</showCloseButton>
  <commandInterface>
    <navigationPanel/>
    <commandBar/>
  </commandInterface>
</form:Form>
